id:     ext:stripe
kind:   service (external)
module: external services
import: github.com/stripe/stripe-go/v79

Called by:
  server.main
  page /checkout
  POST /orders
  POST /webhooks/stripe
  in code: payments.Client.Charge, payments.Handler.verifySignature, payments.NewClient

Tests:
  test:go:shop/internal/orders.TestPlace_ChargesAndInserts  internal/orders/service_test.go:53  via orders.Service.Place
  test:go:shop/internal/orders.TestPlace_OutOfStock  internal/orders/service_test.go:64  via orders.Service.Place
